  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "I boarded another airship village today, when it had stopped to dock. Climbed my way up the anchor and squirreled myself into a cabin before anyone could complain. Everything was going well; the captain, a jolly fellow called Wrenolds, allowed me to teach him how to play Lilyflip. We were half way through a game when it happened. I was winning.",
    "value": "我今天登上了另一个停靠在码头的飞艇村。在别人抱怨之前，我爬上了船锚，把自己藏进了船舱。一切都很顺利，船长是一个叫维尔诺兹的快乐小伙子，他允许我教他弹尤克里里。游戏进行到一半的时候发生了这样的事情。当时我赢了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "The door to the cargo hold splintered open, and a large, metallic Avian came striding out. Swiftly he dispatched a number of the ship's crew, punching and smashing his way around. I cowered in fear, hiding behind the captain, who let off some shots from his rifle.",
    "value": "货舱的门碎裂开来，一个巨大的金属翼族大步走出。他动作迅捷，拳打脚踢地迅速摆平了好几名船员。我吓得缩成一团，躲在船长身后，船长用他的步枪开了几枪。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "The bullets simply bounced off the iron Avian, who laughed, smashed the ship's mast, then leaped into the air. A glowing circle on his chest began to pulsate, then thrusters in the man's feet kicked in, and the Avian took off, soaring into the skies like a rocket ship. What a sight!",
    "value": "子弹简直是从那铁翼族身上弹开了，那鸟人还大笑起来，砸碎了船的桅杆，然后一跃而起。他胸口一个发光的圆环开始搏动，接着他脚底的推进器启动，那翼族便腾空而起，像火箭飞船般冲入天空。真是奇观！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "I was unaware the Avians had developed armour that allowed them to fly again. I commented on this to Wrenolds, and he told me it was unheard of. He muttered something about power crystals, and then I heard him mention my dear friend Greenfinger, who they were apparently going to see. What luck! I informed him he could drop me off there.",
    "value": "我还不知道翼族已经研制出能让他们再度飞行的装甲。我把这想法告诉了维尔诺兹，他却说这闻所未闻。他嘟囔着些什么能量水晶的事，然后我听到他提到了我的好朋友绿手指，他们显然正要去找他。太走运了！我告诉他可以在那儿让我下船。"
  }
]